%% Servicing Agent POC: sequence of every tested demo scenario (scripts/scenarios/01-12, demo-smoke.ps1).
%% Render: GitHub previews .mmd in Markdown only, so view with https://mermaid.live, the VS Code Mermaid
%% extension, or `npx @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i docs/scenarios.mmd -o docs/scenarios.svg`.
%% Source data is read-only for the app (FR-9): every write goes Agent -> Kafka action -> System of record.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Cust as Customer (chat client)
  actor Sup as Supervisor (admin API)
  participant Agent as AgentChatController + Java plan
  participant LLM as LLM (Gemini Flash-Lite)
  participant Tools as Tools (rules, retrieval, tickets, escalation)
  participant Redis as Redis L1 profile
  participant Kafka as Kafka
  participant SoR as System of record (downstream writer)
  participant PG as Warehouse (Postgres)
  participant CDC as Debezium + CDC consumer

  rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 1. Live CDC mutation (Elena)
    PG->>CDC: new LATE_FEE row (WAL)
    CDC->>Kafka: db.public.billing_ledger
    Kafka->>CDC: IdempotentKafkaConsumer (dedup + per-row LSN guard)
    CDC->>Redis: profile updated, log CDC applied
  end

  rect rgb(235, 255, 240)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 2. Autonomous waiver (Elena) - action applied downstream
    Cust->>Agent: Why is my bill 45 higher, can you waive it?
    Agent->>Redis: getCustomerState
    Agent->>Tools: evaluateWaiverRules = APPROVED (Java)
    Tools->>Kafka: agent.actions.waiver (Action produced)
    Kafka->>SoR: consume once (applied_actions)
    SoR->>PG: invoice WAIVED, waivers +1, audit WAIVER_APPROVED_AUTONOMOUS
    PG->>CDC: change captured
    CDC->>Redis: invoice WAIVED
    Agent-->>Cust: approved, cites billing_waivers_policy sec-4.2
  end

  rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 3. ERR-504-GW conflict + SLA escalation (Marcus)
    Cust->>Agent: My gateway is throwing ERR-504-GW
    Agent->>Tools: searchPoliciesAndCases (2026 guide beats superseded 2024 case)
    Agent->>Tools: escalateWithSummary = SLA_BREACH, handoff card
    Tools->>Kafka: agent.actions.escalation
    Kafka->>SoR: audit ESCALATION_HANDOFF
    Agent-->>Cust: canonical fix cited, legacy advice flagged, escalated
  end

  rect rgb(250, 240, 255)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 4. Clean denials (Jordan tier, Marcus waiver limit)
    Cust->>Agent: Can you waive my late fee?
    Agent->>Tools: evaluateWaiverRules = TIER_INELIGIBLE or WAIVER_LIMIT_REACHED
    Note right of Tools: no action published
    Agent-->>Cust: denied with policy reason
  end

  rect rgb(240, 250, 250)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 5. Same problem again - no duplicate ticket (Marcus)
    Cust->>Agent: still getting ERR-504-GW, any update?
    Agent->>Tools: findMatchingOpenTicket = EXISTING_TICKET TKT-8841
    Agent-->>Cust: follow-up on TKT-8841, no new ticket
    Cust->>Agent: POST /api/demo/tickets same problem
    Agent->>PG: read open tickets (row lock)
    Agent-->>Cust: duplicate true, existing TKT-8841
  end

  rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 6. Dormant account - cache miss (Elena)
    Cust->>Agent: What is my latest charge?
    Agent->>Redis: miss or stub profile
    Agent->>PG: bounded point lookups (read only)
    Agent->>Redis: async re-hydrate (SET NX)
    Agent-->>Cust: answered in milliseconds
  end

  rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 7. Poison pill - retries - DLT
    Kafka->>CDC: unparseable record
    CDC->>Kafka: retry 1s, 2s, 4s then db.public.customers.DLT
    Note right of CDC: healthy events keep flowing
  end

  rect rgb(235, 255, 240)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 8. Supervisor override - action, idempotent
    Sup->>Agent: POST /api/admin/overrides/waiver
    Agent->>PG: validate (reads only)
    Agent->>Kafka: agent.actions.waiver
    Agent-->>Sup: ACCEPTED + actionId
    Kafka->>SoR: apply once, audit WAIVER_OVERRIDE
    SoR->>PG: invoice WAIVED
    Sup->>Agent: same override again
    Agent-->>Sup: same actionId, SoR skips duplicate
  end

  rect rgb(255, 255, 235)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 9 and 10. KPIs and prompt caching (live LLM)
    Cust->>Agent: GET /api/agent/reports/kpis
    Agent-->>Cust: deflection, AHT, compliance, DLT, tokens, est. cost, projected caching saving
    Agent->>LLM: same static prefix on every call (one call in LLM mode, several in agent planner)
    Note right of LLM: Turn cost log per turn
  end

  rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 11. Multi-step billing investigation (Riley)
    Cust->>Agent: Why is my bill so high this month?
    alt Deterministic or LLM mode (Java plans)
      Agent->>Tools: 1 billing, 2 tickets, 3 checkWaiverEligibility (not applied), 4 SLA policy
      Agent->>Agent: 5 verify amounts, invoices, tickets, citations
      Agent->>LLM: LLM mode only - word the verified draft
    else Agent planner mode (LLM plans)
      Agent->>LLM: plan
      LLM->>Tools: getCustomerState, findMatchingOpenTicket, checkEligibility, searchPoliciesAndCases
      Agent->>Agent: AGENTIC_VERIFIED or fallback to the deterministic answer
    end
    Agent-->>Cust: 180 overage + 35 late fee, waivable, SLA credit for the outage
  end

  rect rgb(250, 245, 235)
    Note over Cust,CDC: 12. Ticket status inquiry (Elena within SLA, Marcus past SLA)
    Cust->>Agent: Any news on TKT-8841?
    Agent->>Redis: tickets with SLA deadline
    Agent->>Tools: escalateWithSummary (Java enforces it if the model skipped it)
    Tools->>Kafka: agent.actions.escalation when breached
    Agent-->>Cust: status, SLA time left or hours breached
  end
